{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/ntk9kc8mtfk3zszktc3jiqn74yptluu.mp3","text":"博士，准备好工作了吗，不许说没好哦。来，3，2，1，开工！","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/hyg6xhuzxk2ypatzofsinmfo5thrggq.mp3","text":"指甲可是女孩子的魅力点之一，不好好保养怎么行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/cst2h3fsi97x9fnmt45s2fm7b6r1mes.mp3","text":"为什么会叫宴？没什么复杂的原因，就想天天像开宴会一样开心。只要心情好了，什么都会好起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/7ebciitiz4ze1s54l6n1z58lp3p8e3x.mp3","text":"你看到了啊，博士。那就没办法了——陪我一起去把这张双人优惠券用掉吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/iflxe1li9sfvrlwm3iu8w32yl5fpbw6.mp3","text":"患上了矿石病被送到这里来，妈妈怕我受欺负才把家传的狮子王送给我防身。结果嘛，欺负我的人没砍到，坏人倒是割了一茬又一茬。博士你呀，还真是挺会使唤人的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/8y4kiykvd9i1n9otky9mdncpqbdbdxw.mp3","text":"无论是谁，认真做事的时候都会变得很可怕吧。我是六人份的可怕？呃，有这么吓人吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/eem7xe9yi46svkznkn8l5qdbbwzyoln.mp3","text":"明天帮我买十盒限量饼干棒吧，钱从我工资里预支就好。啊？已经预支完了？那......总之，拜托你了，博士，你一定能想到办法的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/231b3y35hf4cnt9jd8359sm25m2oz2m.mp3","text":"博士有时候敏锐得要命，有时候又像块木头一样，到底是为什么呢？啊，我懂了，是那个吧，《闺蜜悄悄话指南》之类的，对吧？不愧是博士呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/tks8ggjgs3yddpm4h0rtq9ujpk5az2r.mp3","text":"太过依赖一个人不是件好事呢，不过，如果是博士的话......啊博士！不没什么我只是在胡思乱想，您您您找我有什么事吗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/o3qh42dd7fthaikatl4oxowxkgishua.mp3","text":"累了就睡吧，别想太多。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/eturcwqvlqn9khfj4lzv9avvlbpndtj.mp3","text":"你好呀博士，我是刚当上干员没多久的宴，兴趣是......嗯，不用那么详细吗？那，以后就请您多多关照了哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/87c8xkxp9gaz8pd746rnnipu6reepp1.mp3","text":"放完了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/sg5c8s8pgjvegmz1nowi1ayaz5o416e.mp3","text":"升职了的话，能不能少干些活呀。唉，不行吗，好吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/le4dy0lw4oaotlqccs8v8k2cq0b7jzt.mp3","text":"该动真格的了。让我们把讨厌的家伙，全部碾碎~","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/8tl6yl5eynq7gldsh46hoij6s6rk16q.mp3","text":"好喔，指挥就拜托各位了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/rze28l5qi10j4w02wynh4rsjb04lbr3.mp3","text":"是队长啊......嗯？我？队长？","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/oridz9yr7jle8nns85eaynx7r7368mc.mp3","text":"出发。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/dfsxffb0uzxaq657d9jz7irgvel0sgt.mp3","text":"来吧，来吧，我等不及了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/0xad5uwm5w4qs0f6uh1i72qpqyqmpe0.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/96/pm0h7fki6nln6027r2n6z9701rk4s3s.mp3","text":"需要我了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/2qit1xa8a5ixmukwlinmuhll1d6f1e7.mp3","text":"我开动了~","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/bv73bo09a1hxmejv3vjmtlqls2bmcb4.mp3","text":"哼哼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/ad3lsqh17475sl1hxlc96kbzzvo327e.mp3","text":"切哪儿比较好呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/ll4e8aa0uuxj8hesb06jtsgepjfri9s.mp3","text":"捅得准就不会痛了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/7rwd3lkgbidrcl9t3p0f3pzd5pp196k.mp3","text":"不要的零件，就送给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/b6q5s6w7hboy4jkhrdlk3d35jug44bn.mp3","text":"你流泪的样子，还挺可爱的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/q118gmxsjmzy9lvazkark9sznlqtjsr.mp3","text":"啊，发泄完了，真开心。博士，我们去吃可丽饼吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/d0ocotzlyv58fejrsne4gxn6v3e9ccm.mp3","text":"很尽兴哦，多谢款待~","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/d3jop3bqs24wx4qfl7yqdoc657vgnj2.mp3","text":"剩下的几个家伙是专门为我而留的吗。那，我就不客气了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/bwlwpw8fdde0hvkfwvxf7mjcwx7o5sn.mp3","text":"别发呆了博士，快跑起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/amciedygscf5e3eshh6lf9smq342dmo.mp3","text":"只要能随时买到新的杂志，住所怎么样其实无所谓的啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/gssvb3e8gswph495kdvkn9h5tyrmk9o.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/7g35ki0wjh05w259bl1pw9xskck0xuq.mp3","text":"一起去唱k吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/167f00rermrdewdkfu7vismxaqaduvl.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/amjta09wd5u45yh2sa84pwqe5ym4cd6.mp3","text":"啊，是博士啊。新年好~如你所见，我被困在这被炉里了~要不要一起来待会，很暖和的。来吧，试试看，你不会后悔的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/7c62yhrsb3353iqww4w0c3zk4hxlhhy.mp3","text":"早上好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_337_utage/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/bfijaiyqfqttxv2z1fgad1p7q53cjm0.mp3","text":"博士，准备好工作了吗，不许说没好哦。来，3，2，1，开工！","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/kgwuar17ms6gl0xc3ghey9im4p85cfy.mp3","text":"指甲可是女孩子的魅力点之一，不好好保养怎么行。","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/j3eg1mass0dsrv1d0pqcw2xcmlnb7lm.mp3","text":"为什么会叫宴？没什么复杂的原因，就想天天像开宴会一样开心。只要心情好了，什么都会好起来。","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/cd03gj4tsua019s8yhb01m0ka8wvysc.mp3","text":"你看到了啊，博士。那就没办法了——陪我一起去把这张双人优惠券用掉吧。","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/esy4qq5okw4p4gmad5nbuvhnlqibiqa.mp3","text":"患上了矿石病被送到这里来，妈妈怕我受欺负才把家传的狮子王送给我防身。结果嘛，欺负我的人没砍到，坏人倒是割了一茬又一茬。博士你呀，还真是挺会使唤人的。","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/7lllrlm37lufq8sdfwlclfoqmzlwx6q.mp3","text":"无论是谁，认真做事的时候都会变得很可怕吧。我是六人份的可怕？呃，有这么吓人吗......","alt":"voice/char_337_utage/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/ipvfwm0ht97k98lppinmft0p632jfid.mp3","text":"明天帮我买十盒限量饼干棒吧，